    "custom_img_text_GhR8Jk": {
      "type": "custom-img-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_gWEChi": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features of NADCO’s Vinyl Tapes & Labels",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_if9aTe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO offers a comprehensive selection of <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/vinyl-material-for-tapes-labels\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/vinyl-material-for-tapes-labels\">vinyl tapes</a> and <a href=\"/pages/vinyl-labels\" title=\"Vinyl Labels\">labels</a>. In addition to offering standard vinyl in an array of color options, we also carry unique and specialized products that we can customize to your needs. We offer graphic designing services, as well as custom printing and die cutting to deliver completely individualized products. </p><p>All vinyl labels and tapes from NADCO are developed to conform to your industry’s safety and OSHA regulations and are UL and FDA-approved. Some unique features of our vinyl material tapes and labels include:</p><ul><li>Anti-slip</li><li>Reflective vinyl tape, available in multiple grades</li><li>Glow-in-the-dark</li><li>Numerous vibrant color options</li><li>Environmentally friendly production</li><li>Industry regulation-compliant</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_gWEChi",
        "text_if9aTe"
      ],
      "name": "custom image text",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "cst_bg_color": "#dae9f2",
        "sec_padd": 0,
        "inner_radius": 0,
        "spin_animation": false,
        "rotationg_speed": 0,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/6973a62774c64a56aab2444d48d0982902018e17.png",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_width": 50,
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "inherit",
        "show_section_divider": false,
        "divider_width": "fixed",
        "padding_top": 50,
        "padding_bottom": 50
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_YpmqDE": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_XaBGkm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Vinyl Material Properties & Benefits",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_CHft4j": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vinyl is a long-lasting material that performs well in many environments. One significant advantage of vinyl material is that it does not degrade over time, resulting in longer shelf life and dependable performance. Vinyl marking tapes and labels stick instantly on contact and are durable enough to even outlast paint. </p><p>Some types of vinyl material are printable. NADCO offers several varieties that feature an ink-receptive coating for easy label-making or logo printing. Vinyl material is also highly resistant to moisture and chemicals and can be further enhanced with a top coating or liquid UV varnish to improve its chemical resistance. Some key vinyl characteristics include:</p><ul><li>Excellent strength and durability</li><li>Easily pliable and can conform tightly around differently shaped objects</li><li>Printable </li><li>Moisture resistant</li><li>Chemical resistant</li><li>Color vibrancy</li><li>Customized printed colors</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_XaBGkm",
        "text_CHft4j"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.name",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/db3b191cc7e7ff25b3a6c94eb6820de23bb89140.png",
