        },
        "heading_4HFh4N": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "Our Vinyl Tape and Label Solutions",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p>NADCO offers a comprehensive line of vinyl tape and label products, customized to meet the needs of any industry. Our highly versatile vinyl products are well-suited to nearly any striping or labeling application and can be further customized to feature write-on capabilities or ink-receptive coatings. <br/><br/>Vinyl products from NADCO meet OSHA requirements while also being heat, water, bacteria, and corrosion-resistant. We offer long-lasting, vibrant adhesive products in numerous sizes, colors, patterns, graphics, and texts. </p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_BAxDnH": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Vinyl Tapes",
            "content": "<p>Vinyl tapes tend to be frequently used where safety is concerned. Our vinyl tape product offerings include but aren’t limited to:</p><ul><li><strong>Hazard marking tape: </strong>Bright colors and clearly printed text identify potential dangers including flammable chemicals, hazardous machinery, steps or elevated pathways, and other hazardous situations. </li><li><strong>Aisle & pathway marking tape: </strong>A vinyl <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/1-floor-marking-tapes\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/1-floor-marking-tapes\">floor marking tape</a> used to define a space within large open warehouses or other industrial and commercial environments. Can be used to create paths for people or machinery or to adhere to OSHA regulations regarding clear walkways. </li><li><strong>Traction tape: </strong>Also called anti-slip tape, this vinyl product reduces the risk of falls in wet environments and provides additional grip along slippery handrails. </li><li><strong>Glow-in-the-dark vinyl tape: </strong>Ensures surfaces and barriers remain highly visible in low-light conditions. </li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_6dCr9p": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Vinyl Labels",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/pages/vinyl-labels\" title=\"Vinyl Labels\">Vinyl labels</a> have excellent fade resistance and durability for outdoor use. They are also conformable and easily removed in one piece but can last up to 10 years depending on the environment. Vinyl labels tend to be used when branding requirements call for a certain degree of thickness yet also a soft touch. </p><p>Our line-up of vinyl label products include but are not limited to:</p><ul><li>Specialty vinyls such as glow-in-the-dark labels and reflective tapes</li><li>Anti-slip vinyl (ASV) labels</li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_dxPDy7": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Custom Labels & Tapes Capabilities ",
            "content": "<p>NADCO is your one-stop solution for custom-developed labels and tapes. Our in-house design team develops high-quality industrial labels, safety decals, manufacturing stickers, advertising materials, and more. From graphic design services to prototyping, digital printing, and die cutting, our full-service manufacturing line reduces lead times and delivers products that meet all your specifications. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_94w7bV": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Contact Our Experts for Premium Vinyl Tape & Label Solutions",
            "content": "<p>Vinyl materials are a high-performing solution for challenging applications throughout many industries. Choosing a customized tape or label from NADCO ensures you receive a superior quality product developed to your exact specifications. To learn more about our custom vinyl solutions, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">contact us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> today. You can also download any of our <a href=\"/pages/downloadable-spec-sheets\" title=\"Downloadable Spec Sheets\">spec sheets</a> for additional information.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
